title: "SIGF: Sequence Integration and Gated Fusion for Brain Tumor Segmentation"
abstract: "SIGF integrates sequence-specific shallow features and uses multiscale gated fusion of parallel CNN and hierarchical Swin features for multimodal brain tumor segmentation. Implementation identifiers retain the earlier MoLG-UNet naming for checkpoint compatibility."
